* power_fit.lib: averaged / behavioural models for the POWER / USB PD group (stage 4 pass B).
* Parameters come from notes/datasheets/*.md; estimates are marked [E] in notes/circuit.md.
* DC (op) models: no switching ripple, no loop dynamics.
* Every threshold is a continuous ramp (no ?: steps) and every limit a smooth minimum
* smin(a,b) = a*b/(a^8+b^8)^(1/8) (9 % below min() at a = b only), so that the Newton operating point
* converges.

* ------------------------------------------------------------------ buck with a feedback pin (averaged)
* ports: vin sw fb en gnd. Voltage-mode: an error amplifier (gain 1e4, 0.05 % FB error at 5 V) drives the SW
* node through 5 mohm, clipped to the duty headroom DMAX*vin; output current limited to ILIM (smooth minimum).
* ISNK (delta 1, D2): forced-PWM negative current limit [A]; 0 = sources only (diode emulation). LM61460AFS:
* -3 A (lm61460.md p.6). The sink branch is multiplied by kon (no sink when disabled / input under UVLO); a
* negative output current returns power into vin (input current negative, efficiency applied in the same way). VEN is the FALLING enable threshold: the
* DC state is a converter that has started (LM61460 EN 1.263 V rising, 28 % hysteresis: 0.91 V falling). Input current = Pout / eff + IQ; eff = EFF5 below VSPLIT output, EFF9 above.
* kon = enable (EN above VEN, ramp 0.2 V) x input UVLO (VUV, ramp 0.5 V).
* Internal nodes: xU.ploss = loss in W, xU.tj = temper + LFRAC*ploss*THETA (junction estimate, C).
.subckt BUCK_FB vin sw fb en gnd params: VREF=1.0 EFF5=0.95 EFF9=0.95 VSPLIT=7 ILIM=6 IQ=1u VEN=1.263
+ THETA=35 LFRAC=1 DMAX=0.95 VUV=3.5 ROUT=5m ISNK=0
Bkon kon gnd V = min(max((v(en,gnd)-{VEN})/0.2+0.5, 0), 1)*min(max((v(vin,gnd)-{VUV})/0.5, 0), 1)
* voltage-mode error amplifier (gain 1e4) clipped to [0, DMAX*vin], 5 mohm source; sources current only
Bv nv gnd V = v(kon,gnd)*min(max(1e4*({VREF}-v(fb,gnd)), 0), {DMAX}*max(v(vin,gnd),0))
Bxi nxi gnd V = (v(nv,gnd)-v(sw,gnd))/{ROUT}
Bi ni gnd V = v(nxi,gnd) >= 0 ? ((v(nxi,gnd))*({ILIM})/pwr(pwr(v(nxi,gnd),8)+pwr({ILIM},8)+1e-60,0.125)) : v(kon,gnd)*((v(nxi,gnd))*({ISNK})/pwr(pwr(v(nxi,gnd),8)+pwr({ISNK},8)+1e-60,0.125))
Bout gnd sw I = v(ni,gnd)
Beff neff gnd V = {EFF5} + ({EFF9}-{EFF5})*min(max((v(sw,gnd)-{VSPLIT})/0.5+0.5, 0), 1)
Bin vin gnd I = v(ni,gnd)*max(v(sw,gnd),0)/max(v(vin,gnd),{VUV})/v(neff,gnd) + {IQ}*v(kon,gnd)
Bp ploss gnd V = abs(v(ni,gnd))*max(v(sw,gnd),0)*(1/v(neff,gnd)-1) + {IQ}*v(vin,gnd)*v(kon,gnd)
Btj tj gnd V = temper + {LFRAC}*v(ploss,gnd)*{THETA}
.ends BUCK_FB

* ------------------------------------------------------------------ TPS65131 boost + inverter (averaged)
* ports: vin vpos fbp vneg fbn vref gnd. VPOS regulated so that V(fbp) = 1.213 V, VNEG so that V(fbn) = 0 V
* (FBN divider between VNEG and VREF), VREF pin = 1.213 V through 10 ohm. Switch current limit not modelled.
.subckt TPS65131_FIT vin vpos fbp vneg fbn vref gnd params: EFFP=0.85 EFFN=0.80 ILIM=1.0 IQ=0.5m THETA=40 VUV=2.7
+ ROUT=50m
Bkuv kuv gnd V = min(max((v(vin,gnd)-{VUV})/0.5, 0), 1)
Vvr vri gnd DC 1.213
Rvr vri vref 10
* voltage-mode outputs (gain 1e4), clipped to +-15 V, 50 mohm source; each stage sources (VPOS) / sinks (VNEG) only
Bvp nvp gnd V = v(kuv,gnd)*min(max(1e4*(1.213-v(fbp,gnd)), 0), 15)
Bip nip gnd V = max((v(nvp,gnd)-v(vpos,gnd))/{ROUT}, 0)
Bpos gnd vpos I = v(nip,gnd)
Bvn nvn gnd V = -v(kuv,gnd)*min(max(1e4*v(fbn,gnd), 0), 15)
Bin2 nin gnd V = max((v(vneg,gnd)-v(nvn,gnd))/{ROUT}, 0)
Bneg vneg gnd I = v(nin,gnd)
Bvin vin gnd I = (v(nip,gnd)*max(v(vpos,gnd),0)/{EFFP} + v(nin,gnd)*max(-v(vneg,gnd),0)/{EFFN})/max(v(vin,gnd),{VUV}) + {IQ}*v(kuv,gnd)
Bp ploss gnd V = v(nip,gnd)*max(v(vpos,gnd),0)*(1/{EFFP}-1) + v(nin,gnd)*max(-v(vneg,gnd),0)*(1/{EFFN}-1) + {IQ}*v(vin,gnd)*v(kuv,gnd)
Btj tj gnd V = temper + v(ploss,gnd)*{THETA}
.ends TPS65131_FIT

* ------------------------------------------------------------------ adjustable current-limited switch
* ports: in out en ilim gnd. ILIM pin held at 1 V; the external network sets I_pin = 1/R; the limit is
* K * (R/1k)^-XP [A] = K * (1000*I_pin)^XP. Reverse current blocked (max(v(in,out),0)). Used for TPS2553
* (K 24.23, XP 0.978: fit of the p.7 points 20 k 1295 mA, 49.9 k 520 mA, 210 k 130 mA).
* Corner selector (stage 5, M2): global node klim (testbench source VKLIM, 0 = typical): klim > 0.5 uses the
* datasheet MAXIMUM limit, klim < -0.5 the MINIMUM. TPS2553 p.7 min/max columns fitted as power laws through
* 49.9 k and 210 k: max = 18.86 / R^0.904 A, min = 28.56 / R^1.0397 A (R in kohm; 49.9 k 550 / 490 mA,
* 210 k 150 / 110 mA).
.subckt ISW_LIM in out en ilim gnd params: RON=0.085 K=24.23 XP=0.978 VEN=1.1 IQ=120u THETA=200
+ KMAX=18.86 XPMAX=0.904 KMIN=28.56 XPMIN=1.0397
Vil ilim gnd DC 1
Bken ken gnd V = min(max((v(en,gnd)-{VEN})/0.2+0.5, 0), 1)
Iq in gnd {IQ}
Blim nlim gnd V = v(klim) > 0.5 ? {KMAX}*pwr(max(-1000*i(Vil),1e-9), {XPMAX}) : (v(klim) < -0.5 ? {KMIN}*pwr(max(-1000*i(Vil),1e-9), {XPMIN}) : {K}*pwr(max(-1000*i(Vil),1e-9), {XP}))
Bxs nxs gnd V = max(v(in,out),0)/{RON}
Bisw nisw gnd V = v(ken,gnd)*((v(nxs,gnd))*(v(nlim,gnd))/pwr(pwr(v(nxs,gnd),8)+pwr(v(nlim,gnd),8)+1e-60,0.125))
Bsw in out I = v(nisw,gnd)
Bp ploss gnd V = v(nisw,gnd)*v(in,out) + {IQ}*v(in,gnd)
Btj tj gnd V = temper + v(ploss,gnd)*{THETA}
.ends ISW_LIM

* TPS25940A eFuse: IOS = 87.5/R(kohm) A (p.5), EN/UVLO 0.99 V rising / 0.92 V falling, OVP pin < 0.99 V to conduct.
.subckt EFUSE_FIT in out en ovp ilim gnd params: RON=0.042 K=87.5 IQ=210u THETA=50 PK=24
Vil ilim gnd DC 1
Iq in gnd {IQ}
* pass 4: corner selector global node kef (0 typ, 1 max, -1 min): IOS window -9 % / +8.5 % (p.5 table at 88.7 k:
* 0.90 / 0.99 / 1.07 A against 87.5/R; notes say -9/+8 %, the wider of each side is used) with R_ILIM at its 0.1 %
* limit (min: R x 1.001, max: R x 0.999). Knee exponent 24 (was 8): below IOS the switch is resistive (Ron), the
* p = 8 knee cut the current ~8 % below IOS, a model artifact that read as limiting at the legitimate load.
Blim nlim gnd V = min({K}*max(-1000*i(Vil),1e-9),1000)*(v(kef) > 0.5 ? 1.085/0.999 : (v(kef) < -0.5 ? 0.91/1.001 : 1))
* steady state after start-up: EN/UVLO at its falling threshold 0.92 V (rising 0.99 V), OVP at its rising
* threshold 0.99 V (p.5); ramps EN 0.90-0.94 V, OVP 0.95-0.99 V
Bon non gnd V = min(max((v(en,gnd)-0.90)/0.04, 0), 1)*min(max((0.99-v(ovp,gnd))/0.04, 0), 1)
* pass 4: nxs / nlim clamped to 1000 A-equivalent (diverging Newton iterates gave pwr() out-of-range aborts)
Bxs nxs gnd V = min(max(v(in,out),0)/{RON},1000)
Bisw nisw gnd V = v(non,gnd)*((v(nxs,gnd))*(v(nlim,gnd))/pwr(pwr(v(nxs,gnd),{PK})+pwr(v(nlim,gnd),{PK})+1e-200,1/{PK}))
Bsw in out I = v(nisw,gnd)
Bp ploss gnd V = v(nisw,gnd)*v(in,out) + {IQ}*v(in,gnd)
Btj tj gnd V = temper + v(ploss,gnd)*{THETA}
.ends EFUSE_FIT

* TPS2546: switch with two ILIM pins (ILIM_SEL high picks ILIM_HI), IOS = 50250/R(kohm) mA typ (p.31).
* ports: in out en sel ilim_hi ilim_lo gnd
.subckt TPS2546_FIT in out en sel ilim_hi ilim_lo gnd params: RON=0.073 IQ=200u THETA=46
Vhi ilim_hi gnd DC 1
Vlo ilim_lo gnd DC 1
Iq in gnd {IQ}
Bks ks gnd V = min(max((v(sel,gnd)-1.0)/0.2+0.5, 0), 1)
Bken ken gnd V = min(max((v(en,gnd)-1.0)/0.2+0.5, 0), 1)
* x = 1/R(kohm) of the selected pin; typ 50.25 x A; corners (global klim, see ISW_LIM) per p.32 eq. 2/3
* (delta review D5): max = 55.325 x^1.0139 + 0.030 A, min = 45.271 x^0.98437 - 0.030 A, evaluated with the 1 %
* resistor at its limit as p.32 asks (max: R x 0.99, i.e. x / 0.99; min: R x 1.01, i.e. x / 1.01)
Blim nlim gnd V = v(klim) > 0.5 ? 55.325*pwr((v(ks,gnd)*max(-1000*i(Vhi),1e-9) + (1-v(ks,gnd))*max(-1000*i(Vlo),1e-9))/0.99,1.0139)+0.03 : (v(klim) < -0.5 ? max(45.271*pwr((v(ks,gnd)*max(-1000*i(Vhi),1e-9) + (1-v(ks,gnd))*max(-1000*i(Vlo),1e-9))/1.01,0.98437)-0.03, 1e-3) : 50.25*(v(ks,gnd)*max(-1000*i(Vhi),1e-9) + (1-v(ks,gnd))*max(-1000*i(Vlo),1e-9)))
Bxs nxs gnd V = max(v(in,out),0)/{RON}
Bisw nisw gnd V = v(ken,gnd)*((v(nxs,gnd))*(v(nlim,gnd))/pwr(pwr(v(nxs,gnd),8)+pwr(v(nlim,gnd),8)+1e-60,0.125))
Bsw in out I = v(nisw,gnd)
Bp ploss gnd V = v(nisw,gnd)*v(in,out) + {IQ}*v(in,gnd)
Btj tj gnd V = temper + v(ploss,gnd)*{THETA}
.ends TPS2546_FIT

* ------------------------------------------------------------------ power MOSFETs with body diode
* AO4407A P-ch 30 V SO-8: about 12 mohm at Vgs -10..-12 V (LCSC listing class); body diode drain -> source
.subckt AO4407A_FIT d g s
M1 d g s s PM_AO4407A
Dbd d s DBODY_P
.model PM_AO4407A PMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=-2.0 KP=12 LAMBDA=0.005 RD=2m RS=2m)
.model DBODY_P D(IS=1e-12 N=1.0 RS=10m BV=40)
.ends AO4407A_FIT

* AO3401A P-ch 30 V SOT-23: about 50 mohm at Vgs -5 V
.subckt AO3401A_FIT d g s
M1 d g s s PM_AO3401A
Dbd d s DBODY_P3
.model PM_AO3401A PMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=-0.9 KP=6 LAMBDA=0.005 RD=5m RS=5m)
.model DBODY_P3 D(IS=1e-12 N=1.0 RS=50m BV=40)
.ends AO3401A_FIT

* AO4406A N-ch 30 V SO-8: about 14 mohm at Vgs 5 V; body diode source -> drain
.subckt AO4406A_FIT d g s
M1 d g s s NM_AO4406A
Dbd s d DBODY_N
.model NM_AO4406A NMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=1.8 KP=25 LAMBDA=0.005 RD=1m RS=1m)
.model DBODY_N D(IS=1e-12 N=1.0 RS=10m BV=40)
.ends AO4406A_FIT

* zener diodes (BZT52 class), Schottky 40 V 1 A (B5819W class), testbench switch
.model DZ12 D(IS=1e-14 N=1.0 RS=5 BV=12 IBV=5m)
.model DSCH40 D(IS=5u RS=0.05 N=1.05 BV=40 IBV=100u CJO=100p)
.model SW_TB SW(VT=0.5 VH=0.1 RON=10 ROFF=1e9)
* testbench plug / unplug switch (PD adapter cable, sink Rd): 1 mohm closed
.model SW_PD SW(VT=0.5 VH=0.1 RON=1m ROFF=1e9)

* ------------------------------------------------------------------ quad open-drain comparator (LMV339 class)
* ports in KiCad pin order: out1 in1- in1+ out2 in2- in2+ out3 in3- in3+ out4 in4- in4+ vcc gnd.
* Output k sinks to gnd through RON when in- > in+ (2 mV linear band, 1 us delay); off below 1.5 V supply.
* IQ 140 uA for the four comparators (LMV339 class) [E]. No input bias, no hysteresis.
.subckt LMV339_OD o1 m1 p1 o2 m2 p2 o3 m3 p3 o4 m4 p4 vcc gnd params: RON=60 TAU=1u IQ=140u
Bkv kv gnd V = min(max((v(vcc,gnd)-1.5)/0.3, 0), 1)
Iq vcc gnd {IQ}
B1 a1 gnd V = v(kv,gnd)*min(max(v(m1,p1)/2m+0.5, 0), 1)
R1 a1 c1 1k
C1 c1 gnd {TAU/1k}
Bo1 o1 gnd I = v(c1,gnd)*max(v(o1,gnd),0)/{RON}
B2 a2 gnd V = v(kv,gnd)*min(max(v(m2,p2)/2m+0.5, 0), 1)
R2 a2 c2 1k
C2 c2 gnd {TAU/1k}
Bo2 o2 gnd I = v(c2,gnd)*max(v(o2,gnd),0)/{RON}
B3 a3 gnd V = v(kv,gnd)*min(max(v(m3,p3)/2m+0.5, 0), 1)
R3 a3 c3 1k
C3 c3 gnd {TAU/1k}
Bo3 o3 gnd I = v(c3,gnd)*max(v(o3,gnd),0)/{RON}
B4 a4 gnd V = v(kv,gnd)*min(max(v(m4,p4)/2m+0.5, 0), 1)
R4 a4 c4 1k
C4 c4 gnd {TAU/1k}
Bo4 o4 gnd I = v(c4,gnd)*max(v(o4,gnd),0)/{RON}
.ends LMV339_OD

* inductor in the DC operating point: its winding resistance only (the converter efficiencies already
* hold the inductor loss, so the default is 1 mohm); keeps the LC filters out of the transient-op fallback
.subckt LDCR a b params: R=1m
R1 a b {R}
.ends LDCR

* pass 6: 74LVC1G123 retriggerable monostable, behavioral (written for this project; timing / threshold values are
* the datasheet-envelope assumptions of notes/circuit.md pass 6). Ports: A B CLR Q CEXT RCEXT VCC GND
* (symbol pins 1 2 3 5 6 7 8 4). A / B Schmitt inputs (VTP / VTN), CLR plain CMOS (VCC / 2). Trigger: A falling
* with B high and CLR high, B rising with A low and CLR high, CLR rising with A low and B high. On a trigger the
* RCext node is discharged (latch until < 0.05 VCC), Q stays high until RCext charges (Rext from VCC) to
* KREF x VCC, KREF = 1 - 0.95 exp(-K) -> tw = K x Rext x Cext. Retriggerable; CLR low clears Q; Q low at power-up.
* ILK: input / RCext leakage to GND (A).
.subckt MONO123_BEH a b clr q cext rcext vcc gnd params: VTP=2.5 VTN=1.5 K=1.0 ILK=0 ROUT=30
Rcx cext gnd 1
Riq vcc gnd 1meg
Ila a gnd DC {ILK}
Ilb b gnd DC {ILK}
Ilc clr gnd DC {ILK}
Ilr rcext gnd DC {ILK}
Bpv pv gnd V = 0.5*(1+tanh((v(vcc,gnd)-1.5)/0.1))
Bas asd gnd V = 0.5*(1+tanh((v(a,gnd)-({VTP}-({VTP}-{VTN})*v(as)))/0.03))
Ras asd as 1k
Cas as gnd 1n
Bbs bsd gnd V = 0.5*(1+tanh((v(b,gnd)-({VTP}-({VTP}-{VTN})*v(bs)))/0.03))
Rbs bsd bs 1k
Cbs bs gnd 1n
Bcl cl gnd V = 0.5*(1+tanh((v(clr,gnd)-0.5*v(vcc,gnd))/0.05))
Ben en0 gnd V = v(pv)*(1-v(as))*v(bs)*v(cl)
Ren en0 en 1k
Cen en gnd 1n
* edge detection without a differentiator (step-size safe): arm = 1 while the trigger condition is false; the
* condition true with arm set -> discharge latch dis (holds until RCext < 0.05 VCC), which clears arm
Bar armd gnd V = max(1-v(en), 0.5*(1+tanh((v(arm)-0.5)/0.05))*(1-v(dis)))
Rar armd arm 1k
Car arm gnd 10n
Bds dsd gnd V = max(v(en)*0.5*(1+tanh((v(arm)-0.5)/0.05)), 0.5*(1+tanh((v(dis)-0.5)/0.05))*0.5*(1+tanh((v(rcext,gnd)-0.05*v(vcc,gnd))/0.02)))
Rds dsd dis 1k
Cds dis gnd 1n
Bdc rcext gnd I = max(v(dis)-0.05,0)*max(v(rcext,gnd),0)/500
Bqs qsd gnd V = v(cl)*v(pv)*max(0.5*(1+tanh((v(dis)-0.5)/0.05)), 0.5*(1+tanh((v(qs)-0.5)/0.05))*(1-(1-v(dis))*0.5*(1+tanh((v(rcext,gnd)-(1-0.95*exp(-{K}))*v(vcc,gnd))/0.02))))
Rqs qsd qs 1k
Cqs qs gnd 1n
Bq qo gnd V = v(qs)*max(v(vcc,gnd),0)
Rq qo q {ROUT}
.ends MONO123_BEH
